# @NAME@

Do not install this package directly. Install [`chronosledger`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/chronosledger):

```sh
npm i -g chronosledger
```

This package holds only the prebuilt `chronos` binary for @OS_LABEL@ @ARCH@. The `chronosledger` package lists all six platform packages as optional dependencies, and npm installs the one that matches your machine. Installed alone, this gives you a binary with no launcher and no update path.

Documentation: <https://chronos.vkrishna04.me>
